'''Pad Twelve''' was the twelfth landing pad at the [[Imperial Center of Military Research]] on [[Scarif]]. It was one of the landing pads attacked by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel]] [[squad]] [[Rogue One]] during the [[Battle of Scarif]].<ref name="Rogue One" />

